work Builder?</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811390/extras/0d527b2ec41da911012553553e066575.poster.avif?t=1765148558\" width=500 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811390/extras/0d527b2ec41da911012553553e066575.webm?t=1765148558\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811390/extras/0d527b2ec41da911012553553e066575.mp4?t=1765148558\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Laugh, shout, blame your friends\u2026 and try again!<br>Play with family, friends, or anyone nearby.<br>Win or lose, you\u2019ll have a great time together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Perfect for Killing Time</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811390/extras/6744587de14497a0bcf3848a9cb1b9f7.poster.avif?t=1765148558\" width=500 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811390/extras/6744587de14497a0bcf3848a9cb1b9f7.webm?t=1765148558\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811390/extras/6744587de14497a0bcf3848a9cb1b9f7.mp4?t=1765148558\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We had so much fun during testing, we didn\u2019t even notice the hours fly by!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["EVNA Games"],"dlc":[4108650],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akam